SpyCameraWeapon Damage/Range + SpyPlaneCameraFrames into SwParams (rules-driven).

The three pinned spy-camera values ([SpyCameraWeapon] Damage=6 reveal
radius, Range=20 photo range, [AudioVisual] SpyPlaneCameraFrames=16 shot
pacing) move into SwParams with matching defaults, resolved from rules
so mods can retune them. The 6 use sites (approach/overfly range gates
and pacing, fallback disc, camera shot) read the params. Save format 75.
Tests in test_superweapon.cpp (fallback disc follows reveal, pacing and
range follow params on a synthetic plane).

